---
import Demo from '../layouts/Demo.astro';
import meta from '../demos/tower/meta';
import Island from '../demos/tower/Demo.tsx';
---
<Demo meta={meta}>
  <Island client:only="react" />
  <div slot="notes">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>Local simulation code predicts conflicts. The model selects an instruction for each aircraft that needs attention, and the simulator applies it while tracking separation and arrivals.</p>
    <h3>Demo scope</h3>
    <p>The aircraft and airspace are fictional. Separation rules, physics and traffic are simplified for the demo. The controller can make unsafe choices and is not suitable for real aviation.</p>
  </div>
</Demo>
